msgstr "Xeración de Certificado"

#: rc.cpp:55
msgid ""
"On this page, you will select whether certificate generation is done "
"centralized or decentralized. Please check with your local help desk if you "
"are unsure what to select here."
msgstr ""
"Nesta páxina seleccionará se quere que a xeración do certificado se faga "
"dun modo centralizado ou descentralizado. Por favor, contacte co seu asesor "
"técnico se está dubidoso de qué escoller."

#: rc.cpp:56
msgid "Certificate &Generation"
msgstr "&Xeración de Certificado"

#: rc.cpp:57
#, fuzzy
msgid "&Centralized generation"
msgstr "Xeración &Centralizada"

#: rc.cpp:58
msgid "Alt+C"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:59
#, fuzzy
msgid "&Decentralized generation"
msgstr "Xeración &Descentralizada"

#: rc.cpp:60
msgid "Alt+D"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:61
#, fuzzy
msgid "&Email address of the CA that issues certificates:"
msgstr "&Enderezo de correo da Autoridade que expende os certificados (CA)"

#: rc.cpp:62
msgid "Your Certificate is Ready to Be Sent"
msgstr "A seu Certificado está Listo para o Envío"

#: rc.cpp:63
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"Your signature key pair is now ready to be sent to the CA (certification "
"authority) which will generate a certificate for you and send it back via "
"email. Please review the certificate shown below. You should also write down "
"the checksum so that you can match it against the certificate sent back by "
"the CA.\n"
"<p>\n"
"If you want to change anything, press Back and make your changes. Otherwise "
"press Finish to send the signature key pair to the CA.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"O seu par de claves de asinar están listas para enviarse á CA (Autoridade "
"do Certificado) que xerará un certificado para vostede e llo enviará por "
"correo electrónico. Por favor, revise o certificado amosado embaixo. "
"Debería tamén anotar a suma MD5 para equipara-la coa que lle será enviada "
"pola CA.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Se vostede quere cambiar calquera cousa, prema Atrás e faga os cambios. "
"Doutro modo prema en Finalizar para enviar o par da claves de asinar á CA.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:64
msgid "Directory Services Configuration"
msgstr "Configuración dos Servicios de Directorio"

#: rc.cpp:65
msgid "X.&500 Directory services:"
msgstr "Servicios de directorio X.&500:"

#: rc.cpp:66
msgid "Server Name"
msgstr "Nome do Servidor"

#: rc.cpp:67
msgid "Port"
msgstr "Porto"

#: rc.cpp:69
msgid "Select Directory Services to Use Here"
msgstr "Seleccione os Servicios de Directorio a Empregar Aquí"

#: rc.cpp:70
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>X.500 Directory Services</h1>\n"
"You can use X.500 directory services to retrieve certificates and "
"certificate revocation lists that are not saved locally. Ask your local "
"administrator if you want to make use of this feature and are unsure which "
"directory service you can use.\n"
"<p>\n"
"If you do not use a directory service, you can still use local "
"certificates.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Servicios de Directorio X.500</h1>\n"
"Pode empregar os servicios de directorio X.500 para recibir certificados e "
"listas de revocación de certificados que non se gardan localmente. Pregunte "
"ó seu administrador local se vostede precisa facer uso de esta capacidade e "
"se está dubidoso de qué servicio de directorio pode empregar.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Se non emprega un servicio de directorio, pode aínda empregar certificados "
"locais.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:71
msgid "Local/Remote Certificates"
msgstr "Certificados Locais/Remotos"

#: rc.cpp:72 rc.cpp:82
msgid "&First local, then directory services"
msgstr "&Primeiro os locais, logo os servicios de directorio"

#: rc.cpp:73
msgid "Click to use both local and remote certificates"
msgstr "Prema para empregar tanto certificados locais coma remotos"

#: rc.cpp:74
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>First Local, Then Directory Services</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the email client will first try to find the "
"necessary certificates on your local computer. If they cannot be found "
"there, it will query the directory services specified in the list above in "
"the order given there.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1Primeiro Local, Despois Servicios de Directorio</h1>\n"
"Cando se selecciona esta opción, o cliente de correo tentará primeiro "
"procurar os certificados precisos na súa máquina local. Se non se atopan, "
"entón pedirá ós servicios de directorio especificados na lista de enriba "
"na orde dada alí.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:75 rc.cpp:85
msgid "&Local only, don't use directory services"
msgstr "Só &locais, non empregar servicios de directorio"

#: rc.cpp:76
msgid "Click to use only local certificates"
msgstr "Prema para empregar só certificados locais"

#: rc.cpp:77
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Local Only, Don't Use Directory Services</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the email client will only try to find the "
"necessary certificates on your local computer. If they cannot be found "
"there, they are not available for the operation in question.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Só Locais, Non Empregar Servicios de Directorio</h1>\n"
"Cando se seleciona esta opción, o cliente de correo só tentará procurar "
"os certificados precisos na súa máquina local. Se non se atopan, non "
"estarán dispoñibles para a operación en cuestión.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:78 rc.cpp:88
msgid "&Directory services only, don't use locally saved information"
msgstr "Servicios de &directorio só, non empregar información gardada localmente"

#: rc.cpp:79
msgid "Click to use remote certificates only"
msgstr "Prema para empregar só certificados remotos"

#: rc.cpp:80
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Directory Services Only</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the email client will not use the certificates "
"on your local computer. Instead, it will query the directory services "
"specified in the list above in the order given there. If none of the "
"services has the certificate in question, it cannot be used for the "
"operation.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Só Servicios de Directorio</h1>\n"
"Cando se selecciona esta opción, o cliente de correo non empregará "
"certificados gardados no seu ordenador. No seu lugar, pediráos ós "
"servicios de directorio especificados na lista de enriba na orde dada alí. "
"Se ningún dos servicios ten o certificado en cuestión, non se poderá "
"empregar para a operación.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:81
msgid "Local/Remote CRLs"
msgstr "CRLs Locais/Remoto"

#: rc.cpp:83
msgid "Click to use both local and remote CRLs"
msgstr "Prema para empregar tanto CRLs locais coma remotos"

#: rc.cpp:84
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>First Local, Then Directory Services</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the email client will first try to find the "
"necessary certificate revocation lists (CRLs) on your local computer. If "
"they cannot be found there, it will query the directory services specified "
"in the list above in the order given there.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Primeiro Locais, logo Servicios de Directorio</h1>\n"
"Cando se selecciona esta opción, o cliente de correo tentará primeiro "
"procurar as listas de revocación de certificados precisas (CRLs) na súa "
"máquina local. Se non se poden atopar aí, pediráas ós servicios de "
"directorio especificadas na lista de enriba na orde alí dada.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:86
msgid "Click to use only local CRLs"
msgstr "Prema para empregar só CRLs locais"

#: rc.cpp:87
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Local Only, Don't Use Directory Services</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the email client will only try to find the "
"necessary certificate revocation lists (CRLs) on your local computer. If "
"they cannot be found there, they are not available for the operation in "
"question.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Só Locais, non empregar Servicios de Directorio</h1>\n"
"Cando se selecciona esta opción, o cliente de correo tentará só procurar "
"as listas de revocación de certificados precisas (CRLs) na súa máquina "
"local. Se non se poden atopar aí, non estarán dispoñibles para a "
"operación en cuestión.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:89
msgid "Click to use remote CRLs only"
msgstr "Prema para empregar só CRLs remotos"

#: rc.cpp:90
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Directory Services Only</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the email client will not use the certificate "
"revocation lists (CRLs) on your local computer. Instead, it will query the "
"directory services specified in the list above in the order given there. If "
"none of the services has the certificate in question, it cannot be used for "
"the operation.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Só Servicios de Directorio</h1>\n"
"Cando se selecciona esta opción, o cliente de correo non empregará as "
"listas de revocación de certificados (CRLs) do seu ordenador. No seu lugar, "
"pedirá as listas ós servicios de directorio especificados enriba na orde "
"alí dada. Se ningún deses servicios ten o certificado en cuestión, non se "
"empregará para a operación.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:91
msgid "&Add Service..."
msgstr "Eng&adir Servicio..."

#: rc.cpp:92
msgid "Click to add a service"
msgstr "Prema para engadir un servicio"

#: rc.cpp:93
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Add a Directory Service</h1>\n"
"By clicking this button, you can select a new directory service to be used "
"for retrieving certificates and CRLs. You will be asked for the server name "
"and an optional description.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Engadir un Servicio de Directorio</h1>\n"
"Premendo neste botón poderá seleccionar un novo servicio de directorio "
"para empregalo na petición de certificados e CRLs. Preguntaráselle polo "
"nome do servidor e por unha descricción opcional.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:94
msgid "&Remove Service"
msgstr "Bo&rrar Servicio"

#: rc.cpp:95
msgid "Click to remove the currently selected service"
msgstr "Prema para borrar o servicio actualmente seleccionado"

#: rc.cpp:96
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Remove Directory Service</h1>\n"
"By clicking this button, you can remove the currently selected directory "
"service in the list above. You will have a chance to rethink your decision "
"before the entry is deleted from the list.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Borrar Servicio de Directorio</h1>\n"
"Premendo neste botón, pode borrar o servicio actualmente seleccionado na "
"lista de enriba. Terá a oportunidade de retroceder antes de que se borre a "
"entrada da lista.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:97
msgid "Encryption Configuration"
msgstr "Configuración de Encriptación"

#: rc.cpp:99
msgid "Encryption &algorithm:"
msgstr "&Algoritmo de Encriptación:"

#: rc.cpp:100
msgid "Store sent messages &encrypted"
msgstr "Gardar as mensaxes enviadas de modo &cifrado"

#: rc.cpp:101
msgid "Check to store messages encrypted "
msgstr "Active isto para gardar as mensaxes de modo cifrado "

#: rc.cpp:102
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Store Messages Encrypted</h1>\n"
"When this box is checked, sent messages are stored encrypted like they were "
"sent. This is not recommended, as you will not be able to read the messages "
"any longer if a necessary certificate expires.\n"
"<p>\n"
"However, there may be local rules that require you to turn this option on. "
"When in doubt, check with your local administrator.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Gardar as Mensaxes Encriptadas</h1>\n"
"Cando se activa esta caixa, as mensaxes se gardan dun modo cifrado tal e "
"como se mandan. Non se recomenda, xa que non será quen de ler as mensaxes "
"posteriormente se un certificado preciso caduca.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Sen embargo, podería haber motivacións para activar esta opción. En caso "
"de dúbida, fáleo co seu administrador local.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:103
msgid "Encr&ypt all message parts"
msgstr "Encr&iptar todas as partes da mensaxe"

#: rc.cpp:104
msgid "Check to have all message parts encrypted by default"
msgstr "Actíveo para que todas as partes da mensaxe sexan encriptadas por defecto"

#: rc.cpp:105
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Encrypt All Message Parts By Default</h1>\n"
"If this option is selected, all parts of a message (i.e. the main message "
"body and all attachments) are encrypted by default.\n"
"<p>\n"
"This is a default setting, you can still override it for each individual "
"message.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt> <h1>Encriptar Todas As Partes Por Defecto</h1>\n"
"Se se selecciona esta opción, todas as partes dunha mensaxe (p.e. o corpo "
"principal e os adxuntos) se encriptan por defecto.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Isto é unha opción por defecto, pero pode desactiva-la en cada mensaxe en "
"concreto.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:106
msgid "Ask &before encrypting each part"
msgstr "Preguntar antes &de cifrar cada parte"

#: rc.cpp:107
msgid "Check to be asked for each part whether to encrypt"
msgstr "Active isto para que se pregunte se se quere cifrar cada parte"

#: rc.cpp:108
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Ask Before Encrypting Each Part</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, you will be asked for each part of the message "
"(i.e. the main message body as well as all attachments) individually whether "
"you want the part to be encrypted.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Preguntar Antes de Encriptar Cada Parte</h1>\n"
"Cando se selecciona esta opción, se lle pedirá individualmente se cada "
"parte da mensaxe (p.e. o corpo da mensaxe e os adxuntos) precisa ser "
"encriptada.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:109
msgid "&Don't encrypt messages"
msgstr "N&on cifrar as mensaxes"

#: rc.cpp:110
msgid "Check for not encrypting a message by default"
msgstr "Actíveo para non cifrar por defecto a mensaxe"

#: rc.cpp:111
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Don't Encrypt Messages</h1>\n"
"If this option is selected, messages are not encrypted by default.\n"
"<p>\n"
"This is a default setting, you can still override it for each individual "
"setting.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Non Encriptar as Mensaxes</h1>\n"
"Se se selecciona esta opción, as mensaxes non se cifrarán por defecto.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Ésta é unha opción por defecto, pero pode aínda omitila para cada "
"mensaxe por individual.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:112
msgid "Triple-DES"
msgstr "Triple-DES"

#: rc.cpp:113
msgid "Selects the encryption algorithm"
msgstr "Escolle o algoritmo de encriptación"

#: rc.cpp:114
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Encryption Algorithm</h1>\n"
"An algorithm is a description for the computer on how it should perform a "
"certain task. The encryption algorithm describes how the computer applies "
"your recipient's key to your message so that only the intended receiver can "
"read the message.\n"
"<p>\n"
"The selection of a certain encryption algorithm determines how easy or how "
"difficult it is to intercept and read a message. However, all algorithms "
"provided in the SPHINX environment are considered to be very safe. "
"Generally, the default will work just fine here.\n"
"<p>\n"
"This setting is a default, you can override it for each individual message.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Algoritmo de Encriptación</h1>\n"
"Un algoritmo é unha descricción para a computadora sobre cómo se debe "
"levar a cabo unha certa tarefa. O algoritmo de encriptación describe cómo "
"a computadora aplica a clave do destinatario á mensaxe, de maneira que só "
"sexa lida polo destinatario pretendido.\n"
"<p>\n"
"A selección dun algoritmo de enrciptación determina a facilidade ou "
"dificultade de interceptación e lectura da mensaxe. Sen embargo, todos os "
"algoritmos providos no entorno SPHINX considéranse moi seguras. Xeralmente, "
"o algoritmo predeterminado funcionará ben.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Esta opción vén por defecto, pode omitila para cada mensaxe individual.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:115
msgid "Certificates"
msgstr "Certificados"

#: rc.cpp:117
msgid "Check can end with locally sa&ved certificate"
msgstr "A comprobación pode rematar cun certificado gardado &localmente"

#: rc.cpp:118
msgid "Check to end with locally saved certificate."
msgstr "A comprobación remata cun certificado gardado localmente."

#: rc.cpp:119
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Certificate Check Can End With Locally Saved Certificate</h1>\n"
"If this option is checked, the check of the certificate chain can end with a "
"locally saved certificate.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Locally saved certificates are your own certificates as well as the "
"certificates of communication partners and certification authorities (CAs).\n"
"</h1>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>A Comprobación de Certificados Pode Remata cun Certificado Gardado "
"Localmente</h1>\n"
"Se se activa esta opción, a comprobación da cadea de certificados pode "
"rematar cun gardado localmente.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Os certificados gardados localmente son os seus propios certificados así "
"coma os certificados de comunicación con compañeiros e autoridades de "
"certificación(CAs).\n"
"</h1>"

#: rc.cpp:120
msgid "Always c&heck to root certificate"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:121
msgid "Check here to check up to the root certificate"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:122
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Always Check Certificate Path To Root Certificate</h1>\n"
"If this option is turned on, the certificate path belonging to the "
"receiver's certificate will always be checked all the way to the root "
"certificate.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:123
msgid "Check certificate &path"
msgstr "Com&probar ruta ó certificado "

#: rc.cpp:124
msgid "Check here to have the whole certificate path checked"
msgstr "Active isto para ter a ruta completa ó certificado comprobada"

#: rc.cpp:125
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Check Certificate Path</h1>\n"
"If this option is turned on, the whole path of the receiver's certificate up "
"to the root will be checked.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Note that it is not possible to turn off checking the receiver's certificate "
"itself.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Comprobar Ruta ó Certificado</h1>\n"
"Se se activa esta opción, a ruta completa ó certificado do receptor será "
"comprobada.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Note que non é posible  desactivar a comprobación do certificado do "
"receptor en sí mesmo.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:127
msgid "&Use certificate revocation lists (CRLs)"
msgstr "&Usar listas de revocación de certificados (CRLs)"

#: rc.cpp:128
msgid "Check to use CRLs"
msgstr "Activar para empregar CRLs"

#: rc.cpp:129
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Use Certificate Revocation Lists (CRLs)</h1>\n"
"A certificate revocation list contains certificates that have been withdrawn "
"and should not be used for encryption purposes any longer. A user may wish "
"to have his or her certificate revoked because he or she suspects that the "
"certificate's integrity has been compromised (e.g. somebody has guessed the "
"PIN).\n"
"<p>\n"
"It is recommended to use CRLs for maximum security. In the configuration "
"dialog for certificate and CRL management, you can select where to retrieve "
"the CRLs from.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:130
msgid "Warn if CRL e&xpires in less than"
msgstr "Advertis se unha CRL ca&duca en menos que"

#: rc.cpp:131
msgid "Check to be warned if a CRL expires in the near future"
msgstr "Activar para ser advertido se unha CRL caduca nun futuro próximo"

#: rc.cpp:132
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Warn If CRL Expires In The Near Future</h1>\n"
"If this box is checked, you will be warned if one of the CRLs you are using "
"is about to expire in the near future.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Advertir se a CRL Caduca nun Futuro Próximo</h1>\n"
"Se se activa esta opción, advertiráselle se unha das CRLs que se están a "
"empregar caduca preto no tempo.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:133 rc.cpp:143 rc.cpp:149 rc.cpp:251 rc.cpp:260 rc.cpp:263
#: vacationdialog.cpp:70
msgid " days"
msgstr " días"

#: rc.cpp:134
msgid "Number of days before warning"
msgstr "Número de días antes da advertencia"

#: rc.cpp:135
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Warn If CRL Expires In The Near Future</h1>\n"
"In this field you can specify how soon before a CRL expires you are warned "
"about this expiry.\n"
"<p>\n"
"The recommended setting for the SPHINX environment is 7 days.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Advertir Se CRL Caduca Nun Futuro Próximo</h1>\n"
"Neste campo pode especificar o número de días antes nos que se debe "
"producir a advertencia.\n"
"<p>\n"
"A opción recomendada para o entorno SPHINX é de 7 días.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:136
msgid "Always encrypt &to self"
msgstr "Sempre encrip&tarse a un mesmo"

#: rc.cpp:137
msgid "Check to have encrypted messages also encrypted using your own key."
msgstr "Activar para ter as mensaxes encriptadas empregando a súa propia clave."

#: rc.cpp:138
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Always encrypt to self</h1>\n"
"If this box is checked, encrypted messages sent by you will also be "
"encrypted using your own key.\n"
"<p>\n"
"It is recommended to leave this option turned on to enable you to read the "
"messages you have sent.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Sempre cifrar a un mesmo</h1>\n"
"Se se activa esta opción, as mensaxes encriptadas enviadas por vostede "
"serán tamén encriptadas empregando a súa propia clave.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Recoméndase activar esta opción para ser quen de ler as mensaxes que xa se "
"enviaron.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:139 rc.cpp:244
msgid "Warnings"
msgstr "Advertencias"

#: rc.cpp:140
msgid "&Warn when trying to send unencrypted messages"
msgstr "Ad&vertir cando se tente enviar unha mensaxe non encriptada"

#: rc.cpp:141
msgid "Check to be warned when sending unencrypted messages."
msgstr "Activar para ser advertido cando se tente enviar mensaxes non encriptadas."

#: rc.cpp:142
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Warn When Trying To Send Unencrypted Messages</h1>\n"
"If this box is checked, you will be warned when you try to send parts of or "
"the whole message unencrypted.\n"
"<p>\n"
"It is recommended to leave this option turned on for maximum integrity.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Advertir Cando se Tente Enviar Mensaxes Non Encriptadas</h1>\n"
"Se se activa esta caixa, advertiráselle cando tente enviar partes ou "
"mensaxes completas non encriptadas.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Recoméndase deixar esta opción activada para unha integridade máxima.\n"
"</q>"

#: rc.cpp:144 rc.cpp:150 rc.cpp:252 rc.cpp:261 rc.cpp:264
msgid "Select the number of days here"
msgstr "Escolla o número de días aquí"

#: rc.cpp:145
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Warn If A Certificate In The Chain Expires</h1>\n"
"Select the minimum number of days all certificates in the chain should be "
"valid without issuing a warning.\n"
"<p>\n"
"The recommended SPHINX setting is 14 days.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Advertir se un Certificado na Cadea Caduca</h1>\n"
"Escolla o número mínimo de días nos que tódolos certificados na cadea "
"deberían ser válidos sen dar unha advertencia.\n"
"<p>\n"
"A opción SPHINX recomendada é de 14 días.\n"
